# Loaded automatically by `next build` (production). Committed on purpose so the
# Docker/Railway build — which sets no env vars — still inlines the Firebase web
# config. These are PUBLIC values (they ship in the browser bundle and are
# duplicated in public/firebase-messaging-sw.js). Same Firebase project as
# youthscores (shared backend). NEXT_PUBLIC_CONFIG_URL is left unset so the app
# uses its same-origin default in production.
